        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Crawler is a horror game where you explore vents but not everything goes to plan, as you explore the vents of Blackwell Station you realize its too late to leave and you must find a new exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE REASON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/3a16eb53bc1032b9463d3631236662f6.poster.avif?t=1777351608\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/3a16eb53bc1032b9463d3631236662f6.webm?t=1777351608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/3a16eb53bc1032b9463d3631236662f6.mp4?t=1777351608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the reason you are here in the first place is because you were called by Lumenex Dynamics the company behind Blackwell Station to go into Blackwell Station through the HVAC system because the facility has been dark for the last 48 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/48f4085b3c372a51c52ccc8e4599734a.poster.avif?t=1777351608\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/48f4085b3c372a51c52ccc8e4599734a.webm?t=1777351608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/48f4085b3c372a51c52ccc8e4599734a.mp4?t=1777351608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twist and turn through the mysterious old and massive ventilation system of Blackwell station while something or someone hunts you down. You will find multiple weird areas almost like other people were living there before you... you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/d9920cc7e8053ba40c8212e0a0b40ec6.poster.avif?t=1777351608\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/d9920cc7e8053ba40c8212e0a0b40ec6.webm?t=1777351608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/d9920cc7e8053ba40c8212e0a0b40ec6.mp4?t=1777351608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover and solve dangerous puzzles disable giant fans, reveal what lies behind a vent door, and power the facility back up. And complete these to escape whatever is hunting you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/3ba4d5a0428240afce27ec69797547f8.poster.avif?t=1777351608\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/3ba4d5a0428240afce27ec69797547f8.webm?t=1777351608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/3ba4d5a0428240afce27ec69797547f8.mp4?t=1777351608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey through Blackwell Station will uncover the secrets and piece together the lore and hidden details of what happened before you... only the most explorative and observant players will uncover it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLE ENDINGS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/0f92d8fc62754774c82e0b2d5f06142f.poster.avif?t=1777351608\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/0f92d8fc62754774c82e0b2d5f06142f.webm?t=1777351608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/0f92d8fc62754774c82e0b2d5f06142f.mp4?t=1777351608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 endings you can achieve by finding secret items or doing things you probably shouldn't do... explore optional areas, find hidden items, and more to unlock the 3 endings and find all the hidden details to get all the lore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXTRA THINGS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/a40575510c156cb27f86681e1ffbfe66.poster.avif?t=1777351608\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/a40575510c156cb27f86681e1ffbfe66.webm?t=1777351608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941650/extras/a40575510c156cb27f86681e1ffbfe66.mp4?t=1777351608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around the vents of Blackwell Station you can find other things to do... but what will you find?</p>",
